{"pageid":953,"title":"Bob Fridman","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Bob Fridman</span>","revid":20982,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Bob Fridman</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/22/Bob_Fridman.png/revision/latest?cb=20240311112016\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Bob Fridman\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/22/Bob_Fridman.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240311112016\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/22/Bob_Fridman.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240311112016 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/22/Bob_Fridman.png/revision/latest?cb=20240311112016 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Bob Fridman\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Bob_Fridman.png\" data-image-name=\"Bob Fridman.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Building\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Building</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Bob Fridman</b>, the master of all things mechanical and owner of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a> on Finlay Island, is the go-to guy for all your Oaklands building needs. Whether you're in need of schematics, conveyors, vehicles, or tools, his shop is open 24/7 and always fully stocked. Just don't try to haggle with him, or he'll make you do laps around Finlay Island with a conveyor belt strapped to your back.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Bob has shaggy black hair. Atop his head rests a construction helmet. He is clad in a white coat paired with long black pants and dark-colored shoes. On his left arm is a watch.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span></h2>\n<p>\"Looking to buy? Talk to me!\" - Interaction Prompt\n</p><p>When no items are placed on the counter:\n</p>\n<ul><li>\"Welcome to Oak Depot! We have all of the tools that you'd ever want or need, so if it catches your eye, BUY IT. PLEASE BUY IT.\"\n<ul><li>Okay!(Ends conversation)</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>When an item is placed on the counter:\n</p>\n<ul><li>\"You sure you'd like to buy [Item_Name] for a total of [Total_Price]? There are no refunds!\"\n<ul><li>Absolutely! (Item is purchased)</li>\n<li>No thank you, I'm good. (Ends conversation)</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>When an item is placed on the counter, but it is too expensive:\n</p>\n<ul><li>\"Oh... you don't have enough money. That's okay, come back again another time when you do!\"\n<ul><li>No thank you, I'm good. (Ends conversation)</li>\n<li>Buy Money (Opens shop to Cash Section)</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:NPC_Nav\" title=\"Template:NPC Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:NPC_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:NPC_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy